  "important_caveats": [
    "This experiment was designed after original official test scores had already been examined; it is development-only exploratory research, not independent proof of test-set improvement.",
    "Symptom prompts are heuristic from known class names, not expert-verified plant pathology semantics.",
    "Balanced batching samples with replacement; training exposure differs from uniform sampling.",
    "The pair loss is cross-entropy over all 9,625 possible pairs, even the withheld combinations. This can increase seen-pair bias; bias-sweep is descriptive only.",
    "Cross-host SupCon requires multi-crop diseases and cannot enforce invariance for single-crop diseases.",
    "Feature cache frozen-CLIP arms cannot change spatial visual features; optional partial fine-tuning explores this separately.",
    "No official test calibration, checkpoint selection or retesting is included.",
    "Zero-shot pretrained OpenCLIP may have encountered related public images in its pretraining corpus."
  ]
}